    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Your mastery keeps certain spells always at the ready. Once you have spell slots of a level shown in the Conjuration Adept Spells table, you always have the spells of that level and lower prepared.</p><p><strong>Persistent Conjuration.</strong> While you maintain Concentration on a Conjuration spell, you gain a bonus to the Constitution saving throws you make to maintain that Concentration, equal to the modifier of the ability score increased by this feat.</p><h4>Conjuration Adept Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Spell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEntangle00]{Entangle}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMistyStep0]{Misty Step}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConjureAni]{Conjure Animals}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConjureEle]{Conjure Elemental}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-PbLZWRYFRcBXUDem\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spells of the levels whose slots you have; add the others when you gain those slots.</p></section>",
